==Description==
'''Cultist Ramiel Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[Operation I.C.E Event]] as a reward for reaching Level 34 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{Bell|1,190}} or {{Robux|158}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Bell|19,030}} or {{Robux|3,670}}.

==Appearance==
'''Cultist Ramiel Charm''' appearance is based on [[Ramiel]], one of the [[Children of Exo]]. More specifically, it uses [[Ramiel]]'s [[Hexscape Event]] design instead of either the janitor disguise or the shirtless appearance. The charm has a light blue color with a crystallized texture. When placed down, it plays a sound of a crystallic object behind dropped down.

The charm has a light blue color with a crystallized texture. It does not change colors.

